  "worked_solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Qg & =[\\begin{aligned}m & 2m \\\\ -m & n\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}m\\cdot (-2)+2m\\cdot 3 \\\\ -m\\cdot (-2)+n\\cdot 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2m+6m \\\\ 2m+3n\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4m \\\\ 2m+3n\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
